    "detailedAnswer": "Problem: Group anagrams.\nSample input: eat,tea,bat\nExpected output: [[eat,tea],[bat]]\n\nApproach: Use sorted letters as key.\n\nJava solution:\nimport java.util.*;\nimport java.util.stream.*;\n// Method or class excerpt; place methods inside a Java class.\nCollection<List<String>> group(String[] a){Map<String,List<String>>m=new LinkedHashMap<>();for(String s:a){char[] c=s.toCharArray();Arrays.sort(c);m.computeIfAbsent(new String(c),k->new ArrayList<>()).add(s);}return m.values();}\n\nTime complexity: O(n L log L)\nSpace complexity: O(n L)\nAssume valid inputs and values within numeric limits unless stated otherwise.",
