    "shortAnswer": "Maintain heap of k largest values",
    "detailedAnswer": "Problem: Kth largest.\nSample input: [3,1,5,2],2\nExpected output: 3\n\nApproach: Maintain heap of k largest values.\n\nJava solution:\nimport java.util.*;\nimport java.util.stream.*;\n// Method or class excerpt; place methods inside a Java class.\nint kth(int[] a,int k){PriorityQueue<Integer>q=new PriorityQueue<>();for(int x:a){q.add(x);if(q.size()>k)q.poll();}return q.element();}\n\nTime complexity: O(n log k)\nSpace complexity: O(k)\nAssume valid inputs and values within numeric limits unless stated otherwise.",
