    "detailedAnswer": "Problem: Reverse linked list.\nSample input: 1->2->3\nExpected output: 3->2->1\n\nApproach: Reverse next pointers.\n\nJava solution:\nimport java.util.*;\nimport java.util.stream.*;\n// Node: int val; Node next; Node(int val) constructor.\n// Method or class excerpt; place methods inside a Java class.\nNode rev(Node h){Node p=null;while(h!=null){Node n=h.next;h.next=p;p=h;h=n;}return p;}\n\nTime complexity: O(n)\nSpace complexity: O(1)\nAssume valid inputs and values within numeric limits unless stated otherwise.",
