    "detailedAnswer": "Problem: Merge sorted linked lists.\nSample input: 1->3,2->4\nExpected output: 1->2->3->4\n\nApproach: Attach smaller head.\n\nJava solution:\nimport java.util.*;\nimport java.util.stream.*;\n// Node: int val; Node next; Node(int val) constructor.\n// Method or class excerpt; place methods inside a Java class.\nNode merge(Node a,Node b){Node d=new Node(0),t=d;while(a!=null&&b!=null){if(a.val<=b.val){t.next=a;a=a.next;}else{t.next=b;b=b.next;}t=t.next;}t.next=a!=null?a:b;return d.next;}\n\nTime complexity: O(n+m)\nSpace complexity: O(1)\nAssume valid inputs and values within numeric limits unless stated otherwise.",
    "detailedAnswerTelugu": "సమస్య: Merge sorted linked lists\nఉదాహరణ input: 1->3,2->4\nExpected output: 1->2->3->4\n\nపరిష్కారం: చిన్న head ను జోడించండి.\n\nJava code:\nimport java.util.*;\nimport java.util.stream.*;\n// Node: int val; Node next; Node(int val) constructor.\n// Method or class excerpt; place methods inside a Java class.\nNode merge(Node a,Node b){Node d=new Node(0),t=d;while(a!=null&&b!=null){if(a.val<=b.val){t.next=a;a=a.next;}else{t.next=b;b=b.next;}t=t.next;}t.next=a!=null?a:b;return d.next;}\n\nTime complexity: O(n+m)\nSpace complexity: O(1)\nసరైన input మరియు numeric limits లోని విలువలను ఉపయోగించండి.",
