    "shortAnswer": "Resolve smaller pending indices",
    "detailedAnswer": "Problem: Next greater element.\nSample input: [2,1,3]\nExpected output: [3,3,-1]\n\nApproach: Resolve smaller pending indices.\n\nJava solution:\nimport java.util.*;\nimport java.util.stream.*;\n// Method or class excerpt; place methods inside a Java class.\nint[] next(int[] a){int[] r=new int[a.length];Arrays.fill(r,-1);Deque<Integer>s=new ArrayDeque<>();for(int i=0;i<a.length;i++){while(!s.isEmpty()&&a[s.peek()]<a[i])r[s.pop()]=a[i];s.push(i);}return r;}\n\nTime complexity: O(n)\nSpace complexity: O(n)\nAssume valid inputs and values within numeric limits unless stated otherwise.",
    "detailedAnswerTelugu": "సమస్య: Next greater element\nఉదాహరణ input: [2,1,3]\nExpected output: [3,3,-1]\n\nపరిష్కారం: చిన్న pending indices కు సమాధానం ఇవ్వండి.\n\nJava code:\nimport java.util.*;\nimport java.util.stream.*;\n// Method or class excerpt; place methods inside a Java class.\nint[] next(int[] a){int[] r=new int[a.length];Arrays.fill(r,-1);Deque<Integer>s=new ArrayDeque<>();for(int i=0;i<a.length;i++){while(!s.isEmpty()&&a[s.peek()]<a[i])r[s.pop()]=a[i];s.push(i);}return r;}\n\nTime complexity: O(n)\nSpace complexity: O(n)\nసరైన input మరియు numeric limits లోని విలువలను ఉపయోగించండి.",
