    "detailedAnswer": "Problem: Jump game.\nSample input: [2,3,1,1,4]\nExpected output: true\n\nApproach: Track farthest reachable index.\n\nJava solution:\nimport java.util.*;\nimport java.util.stream.*;\n// Method or class excerpt; place methods inside a Java class.\nboolean jump(int[] a){long reach=0;for(int i=0;i<a.length;i++){if(i>reach)return false;reach=Math.max(reach,(long)i+a[i]);}return true;}\n\nTime complexity: O(n)\nSpace complexity: O(1)\nAssume valid inputs and values within numeric limits unless stated otherwise.",
